Problem Statement:

Develop a water depot network system

using a graph (adjacency list) and a min-priority queue.

Water depot, road junctions and repair locations are stored as vertices,

roads between them are stored as edges with non-negative distances (km),

and Dijkstra's algorithm finds the least-cost route from a selected source to a selected repair location.

It displays the complete shortest path and total distance, not only the distance,

lets the user select a different source vertex and recalculate the shortest distances,

and updates a road distance and recalculates the shortest paths.

It supports add location, add road, display locations,

display network, and shortest route search.
